00:30.283 --> 00:37.294
[SPEAKER_01]: them and to a certain extent anticipate that they're about to happen. And that is the training that you need to fly a really hot glider.

00:47.293 --> 00:55.961
[SPEAKER_03]: what's up everybody welcome back to another episode of paragliding atlas this time around we are navigating the topic of risk versus reward

00:56.301 --> 01:04.789
[SPEAKER_03]: and in installment two we have a very special guest who also happens to be a very dear friend a very humble person as well to talk to and most

