06:06.852 --> 06:15.194
[SPEAKER_01]: somewhere else. I've really enjoyed every moment and I continue to enjoy every moment of. Wow. I think for our listeners who do not believe,

06:15.234 --> 06:26.176
[SPEAKER_03]: let me reiterate, that's three and a half years, more than 1500 hours in the air. God damn it, man. What a life and what an amazing dedication. And

