[SPEAKER_03]: I think for those of them who are wondering, why do you still have your school wings? That's because Sevier likes to fly the life out of the

06:32.902 --> 06:42.551
[SPEAKER_03]: wing, so they're practically not sellable anymore. All 500 hours are exhausted, and the remaining ones are probably going out in packaging

06:42.591 --> 06:50.218
[SPEAKER_03]: and ground handling. So that's why those are mementos and trophies of glory and hard work, which you probably deserve. But Honestly, I wish

