[SPEAKER_01]: motivation, then the discipline becomes easier. And for me, the motivation is simply... to see the world by foot and by paraglider. And

23:32.660 --> 23:43.266
[SPEAKER_01]: that means I have to be physically strong so I can hike and that I become a good pilot so I can fly long distances. And that is the motivation for me

23:43.286 --> 23:52.686
[SPEAKER_01]: lately. That's amazing to hear. So this puts a thought in my mind. Let's say all of us have heard a term that too much of something is bad. And of

